# Copy to .env.local and fill in values. Never commit .env.local.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVACY_EMAIL=privacy@housemira.com
# Supabase Edge Function used to send family invite emails (see
# src/features/invite-family/lib/send-invite-email.ts). SUPABASE_URL is
# required (no default); the app fails fast at startup when it is missing.
# The anon key is sent as both the `Authorization: Bearer` token and the
# `apikey` header.
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=[YOUR_ENV_KEY]
# SUPABASE_INVITE_FUNCTION_NAME=resend-email-v1
# Bot gate: Cloudflare Turnstile secret for the invite form (see README
# "Invite email authorization & abuse protection"). Required in production —
# without it sendInviteAction fails closed with a generic error. Leave unset
# in dev/test.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=[YOUR_TURNSTILE_SECRET]
# Shared rate limit for serverless / multi-instance rollouts (Upstash Redis
# REST). When both are set, the invite limiter counts against shared Redis;
# when unset, the limiter is in-memory and the rollout MUST stay
# single-instance (see README).
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-db.upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=[YOUR_UPSTASH_TOKEN]
